cafe5758f0dd,OPP:Kor Structural - Short Form Agreement re L4 Canopy Glass,,,,client,draft,1/1,yes,2025-08-13,opportunities,"Management\Project Opportunities\Pending\Kor Structural - Short Form Agreement re L4 Canopy Glass - Aug 12, 2025.docx",,0p1,GOODS AND/OR SERVICES AGREEMENT,payment|permits_approvals,234,"GOODS AND/OR SERVICES AGREEMENT
This Goods and/or Services Agreement (this “Agreement”) is made as of August , 2025 by and between KSV Restructuring Inc., solely in its capacity as Court-appointed receiver of 6511 Sussex Heights Development Ltd. (“Purchaser”) and not in its personal, corporate, or any other capacity, and Kor Structural (“Seller”) in connection with goods and services for the development project known as “Highline – 6505 Sussex Avenue” (the “Project”) located at 6505 Sussex Avenue, Burnaby, British Columbia.
Purchaser wishes to purchase from the Seller the following Goods and Services: 
Goods: N/A.
Services: Seller to provide engineering services required to relocate and install the canopy glass (the “L4 Canopy Glass”) above the outdoor space on level 4 (the “L4 Patio”), which is required to obtain the full occupancy permit from the City of Burnaby for the Project.
Contract Price: No greater than $1,050 plus GST, as summarized in the schedule below:

Note: Number of hours shown is an estimate to provide a fee (invoice submitted monthly in lump sum format). GST is not included and will be added when required. All additional fees and costs not outlined in the table above must be approved by Purchaser prior to same being incurred.
Delivery Schedule: Per the Schedule agreed to by Purchaser.
Delivery Point: 6505 Sussex Avenue, Burnaby, British Columbia.
Notices:
The parties have duly executed this Agreement as of the date first written above."
