The Project is a new supportive housing development for at-risk individuals, consisting of
design and development of an 8-storey cast-in-place concrete building with 76 studio units with
one lower level of back-of-house service rooms and one level of common areas and offices.
Landscaping will be provided around the perimeter of the building as well as at the rooftop
level.
The building shall be designed to fully comply with all applicable codes, and shall meet VBBL
and BC Energy Step Code Step 3 energy performance targets while applying Passive House
principles within the commited scope of BC Energy Step Code Step 3.
