Provided that the Agreement otherwise has been reviewed from fiscal, 
administrative, insurance, and engineering perspectives, I have the following comments 
and recommendations in order to make the Agreement clearer and more favorable to 
you: 
(1) 
Regarding the introductory paragraph: 
(a) 
The Effective Date should be revised. Indeed, there should not be 
a retroactive Effective Date. 
