As part of the Courthouse Commons project, The South Block is a 37-story Type I High-Rise with S-stories of
subterranean parking totaling 273,000 gross square feet (GSF), 16,000 GSF of ground floor retail, 265,000 GSF of core
and shell office at Levels 1-8, 10,000 GSF of mixed amenities at Level 9, 431 residential units at Levels 9-36 totaling
437,000 GSF and 6,000 GSF of roof top amenity space and pool deck at Level 37. The project site is bound by C St. to
the north, Broadway to the south, Front St. to the east and Union St. to the west."
