requirements set forth in this Section V. Without in any way limiting Consultant’s defense and indemnification obligations under Section IV of 
this Agreement, Consultant shall maintain the following insurance coverages and comply with the following insurance requirements at all times 
during the term of this Agreement and thereafter, as specified herein. 
