parties listed in Section V, paragraph F, below. Such insurance shall be in strict accordance with the applicable workers’ 
compensation laws in effect during performance by Consultant pursuant to this Agreement and during performance by any 
consultant, subconsultant or subcontractor. Consultant shall require each of its consultants, subconsultants and subcontractors to 
