98630fabc82f,10189-01,10189-01,Wesgroup Properties Ltd.,RD Parcel 35/36 Vancouver Pursuit,client,draft,1/2,,2024-09-03,opportunities,Management\Project Opportunities\Submitted to Client\Wesgroup RD Parcel 35& 36 Vancouver JM KW (DUE SEP 17 10189-01)\1.0 Standard Form Consultant Agreement.pdf,,2.4,Payment. The following will apply with respect to payment of an invoice:,payment|assignment_subconsultants,203,"2.4 Payment. The following will apply with respect to payment of an invoice: 
(a) 
Invoices, along with a Contract Summary Report, must be submitted to ap-dev@wesgroup.ca 
prior to the 25th of a month for payment by the Owner to be made on the last day of the following 
month. Invoices received after the 25th of a month will not be processed for payment until the 
following month and payment will become due on the last day of the second month after receipt 
of the invoice. 
(b) 
The amount invoiced by the Consultant shall be the value of the Services performed by the 
Consultant or any subconsultant on or before the date of the invoice, proportionate to the 
Contract Price (as shown in Schedule “B” – Compensation) agreed to between the Owner and 
the Consultant. 
(c) 
If the Owner does not agree with the invoice or portion of an invoice, the Owner will review the 
invoice with the Consultant. If the disagreement cannot be resolved between the Owner and the 
Consultant, the Owner will pay the undisputed portion of the invoice and will include with the 
payment an explanation for any such invoice reduction and withhold the disputed payment until 
such dispute is resolved."
