executed or not, and whether or not the Consultant has been paid for the Services. The Consultant 
represents and warrants that it has not breached, and will not breach, any third party’s intellectual 
property rights in connection with the performance of the Services."
98630fabc82f,10189-01,10189-01,Wesgroup Properties Ltd.,RD Parcel 35/36 Vancouver Pursuit,client,draft,1/2,,2024-09-03,opportunities,Management\Project Opportunities\Submitted to Client\Wesgroup RD Parcel 35& 36 Vancouver JM KW (DUE SEP 17 10189-01)\1.0 Standard Form Consultant Agreement.pdf,,4.2,Grant of Licence.  Subject to the Owner’s fulfilment of its payment obligations under this,intellectual_property|termination|permits_approvals,231,"4.2 Grant of Licence. Subject to the Owner’s fulfilment of its payment obligations under this 
Agreement, the Consultant hereby grants to the Owner an irrevocable, perpetual, nonexclusive, fee-free, 
royalty-free, assignable licence to use, reproduce, or publish (including in a future procurement process), 
and to permit others on behalf of the Owner to use, reproduce, or publish (including in a future 
procurement process), any intellectual property rights owned by, controlled by, licensed to or used by the 
Consultant to the extent such intellectual property rights are incorporated into the Work Product, in 
connection with the construction, completion, operation, maintenance, repair, refurbishment or alteration 
of the Project or any part of the Project, including in the event of termination of the Consultant prior to 
completion of the design. 
“Work Product” means anything created or developed by or on behalf of the Consultant, whether alone 
or jointly with others, in connection with the Services, including, without limitation, all designs, reports, 
photographs, drawings, plans, specifications, computer software and print-outs, surveys, calculations and 
other data, information and materials collected, computed, drawn, created, developed or produced by the 
Consultant in the performance of the Services and all concepts, products or processes produced by or 
resulting from the Services rendered by the Consultant, or which are otherwise developed or first reduced 
to practice by the Consultant, whether alone or jointly with others, in the performance of the Services."
