1967eec46ad4,40102-07,40102-07,Path General Contractors,990 George St Core Hole Review,KOR,proposal,,,2023-06-08,opportunities,Management\Project Opportunities\Word Documents for Awarded Projects\40102-07 Path General Contractors 990 George St Vancouver BC 2023-06-08 KOR KW.docx,,0,(preamble),insurance|payment|permits_approvals|assignment_subconsultants|field_review,424,"June 8, 2023

