Project Personnel and Experience

John Bryson and John Bryson & Partners have designed more than 2 million square feet of tilt-up office/commercial buildings. An Introduction to John Bryson & Partners is attached to this proposal, and also a list of recent tilt-up office/commercial projects. Please note that we have designed three projects in the Glenlyon Business Park to date.

