in connection with the Project is not to be construed as publication in derogation of the reserved rights of the 
Consultant’s subconsultants. Consultant and Consultant’s subconsultants shall not reuse for any other project or 
purpose any portion of its design developed for the Project and/or for Owner without Owner’s advance written 
consent. 
 
§ 5.4 Upon execution of this Agreement, the Consultant grants to the Owner a nonexclusive license to use the 
Consultant’s Instruments of Service solely and exclusively for purposes of designing, constructing, using, 
