surveys, models, sketches, drawings, specifications, and other similar materials in digital or physical form. 
 
§ 5.2 The Consultant and the Owner warrant that in transmitting Instruments of Service, or any other information, 
the transmitting party is the copyright owner of such information or has permission from the copyright owner to 
transmit such information for its use on the Project. If the Owner and Consultant intend to transmit Instruments of 
Service or any other information or documentation in digital form, they shall endeavor to establish necessary 
protocols governing such transmissions or comply with protocols established for the Project, if any. 
 
