Enclosed is our fee proposal for structural engineering services for the above noted project. The project 
consists of a single 33 storey tower and mid-rise building, over underground parking. We understand that 
our services for this project will consist of preliminary input regarding the structural system only. We will 
provide PDF plan markups showing our recommendations for structural layout and preliminary sizing of the 
structure. We will not provide any CAD or Revit models for this portion of the work. 
 
