Proposed Fees / Project Description 
 
Our scope of services includes review of core hole of the hotel levels and areas required at parking levels. 
Each of the proposed core locations, as well as the diameter of each, are to be clearly indicated on the 
Structural Final Design Drawing provided by us in PDF format (attached). The fee may be adjusted based 
on the final number of core holes required. 
 
 Review of proposed core hole locations (300 Core Holes) 
 Preparation of a written report, if required 
 
Our scope of services does not include: 
 
 Remedial work for any core hole that cuts through more reinforcement than specified in this review. 
 Any remedial work is considered extra. 
 
The proposed fee for reviewing the Core Hole is $50/core hole and all the coordination work will be charged 
on an hourly rates basis in accordance with the following list of hourly charge out rates: 
 
 Senior Structural Engineer ..................................................... $250 
 Technologist / Construction Inspector .................................... $175 
 
Upon acceptance of the proposed fees, we require a retainer payment of $7,000 prior to commencement 
of services. The retainer will be applied to the final invoice. 
 
ln addition to the above fixed fee, we propose to charge for any additional services outside the original 
scope of work on an hourly rates basis in accordance with above mentioned charge out rates: 
 
The contractor will remain responsible for safety in and about the jobsite, and for the adequacy of any 
construction equipment, scaffold, shoring, form, or other work aid used by him (the contractor). 
 
Please note that we carry sufficient professional liability insurance. 
 
 

