Dear Sir: 

Re: Fee Proposal for Additional Structural Engineering Services – Owner requested suite revisions.
 495 Hartford Avenue, Los Angles, California 
 Kor Reference Number: 30911-01 X.4 03

We have been asked by Intergulf Development to provide additional structural engineering services to revise the structural design to accommodate the following changes to the building:

Residential Units have been changed from 2 bedroom to 1 bedroom suites for several different units over the height of the building – Level 1 thru 7. The following redesign of the structure is required as a result:

(Woodframe levels) Suite changes from 2br to 1br – results in relocated wood frame bearing walls and shearwalls for the wood frame levels 4 to Roof (8). 
This requires a redesign of the entire woodframe structure for seismic resistance
And redesign of localized woodframe gravity load carrying elements.
(Concrete Levels) Suite changes from 2br to 1br – results in relocated concrete columns for the concrete levels 1 to 3. 
This requires a local redesign of the slabs once columns are relocated.
 The transfer slab at level 1 will also require localized redesign due to the load re-distribution from the relocated columns. 
Also a concrete shearwall that extends down thru the below grade structure to the foundation requires relocation due to the revised suite layout – this requires localized redesign of the parking levels and foundation.

The proposed fixed fees for these additional services are as follows:

$20,000 Start Up fee 
$25,000 Design Development
$40,000 Construction Documents

$85,000 Total Redesign Fee




Note: All of the revisions noted above also require updates to the structural calculations for resubmittal to 
the city for Building Permit plan check review. 
 
We have proceeded with this work in good faith in preparation for revised pricing drawings and City Plan 
Check response. 
 
 We trust the above information is satisfactory, please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any 
questions. 

Yours truly,

Kor Structural USA Inc.







_____________________________________ 
Jim DesRoches, PE 
Managing Principal 
 


Fee Proposal accepted, and Professional Liability Insurance Advice acknowledged.

Intergulf Development Group 

