We have been asked by Intergulf Development to provide additional structural engineering services to revise the structural design to accommodate addition of the following roof top equipment:

Exterior Maintenance system by Skyrider submitted to us by Fassberg construction shown on shop drawings dated 5-29-2024 requires the structure to be modified to suit as noted below:

At all anchor locations changes to the roof structural framing will be required.
Additional framing beams to resist anchor loads will be required
In multiple locations existing framing must change direction
Strapping and tiedown hardware will need to designed to accommodate anchor uplift loads.
Buttress walls supporting tall parapets need to be reconfigured to accommodate tieback locations and clearance requirements.
Further coordination with skyrider and architect required.
Further coordination with mech consultant required.
Further review and coordination of shop drawings.
Response to plan check comments resulting from Deferred submittal by Fassberg
Structural observations during installation


