herein provided. The Company may utilize the aforementioned documents, in whole or in part, directly or in modified form, in 
connection with the Project, without further employment of or additional compensation to Consultant. Company has the absolute 
right to use the Instruments of Service to complete any project in the event of termination of this Agreement or a default by 
Consultant, as well as to use the Instruments of Service for any other purpose. All plans, drawings, specifications or other 
documents produced by Consultant or its subcontractors produced in connection with the Project shall be the sole property of 
Company and may not be used or reproduced for any purpose without Company’s consent. For purposes of this Section VI, 
“Instruments of Service” shall mean and include, without limitation, all reports, plans, studies, models, drawings, sketches, 
estimates, bids, letters, data sheets, maps and work sheets produced, acquired or prepared by or for Consultant in connection 
with the performance of this Agreement. Consultant agrees that it will provide copies of the Instruments of Service to Company 
regardless of whether there is any dispute between Company and Consultant, including any dispute regarding payment to the 
Consultant. Consultant agrees it will defend and indemnify Company under the terms of Section IV above for any losses or 
damages caused by Consultant's delay or refusal in making Instruments of Service available as required by this Section."
