IV. 
DEFENSE AND INDEMNITY 
To the fullest extent permitted by law, Consultant shall indemnify, defend and hold harmless Company and its officers, directors, agents, 
employees, divisions, subsidiaries, partners, members, shareholders, affiliates, successors and assigns, and lender(s), if any, (collectively, 
Company, the other parties listed above and the Company’s lender(s) are referred to as the “Indemnified Parties”) from and against any and all 
losses, damages, allegations, liabilities, demands, expenses (including, without limitation, reasonable investigative expenses, expert and 
consultant expenses), costs, debts, actions, causes of action, suits, penalties, fines, judgments, claims and liens (including mechanics’ liens 
and stop notices), and reasonable attorneys’ fees, including, without limitation, the cost of appellate proceedings and disbursements 
(collectively, “Liability”), arising out of or relating directly or indirectly to any or all of the following, whether actual or alleged: 
A. 
Death or bodily injury or personal injury to people (including, without limitation, Consultant’s employees or employees of any of the 
Professional Parties, as defined below) or damage or injury to property, arising out of or in connection with this Agreement or the 
performance of the Services by Consultant, its agents, employees, consultants, subconsultants, subcontractors, suppliers, anyone 
employed directly or indirectly by any of them or for whose acts they may be liable, or any or all of them (collectively, the 
“Professional Parties”); 
B. 
the acts, errors and/or omissions (including, without limitation, the negligent or willful acts, errors and/or omissions) of Consultant 
and/or the Professional Parties, arising out of or in connection with this Agreement or the performance of the Services; 
C. 
the presence, or activities conducted, in, at or about the Project, of or by Consultant and/or the Professional Parties, or any of them; 
E. 
any and all liens, stop notices and charges of any type, nature, kind or description which may at any time be filed, recorded, or 
claimed against the site of the Project or any portion thereof, or against the Company or Company’s lender(s), if any, (except when 
such liens or stop notices are caused solely by Company’s default in its obligation to pay Consultant undisputed sums pursuant to 
the provisions of this Agreement) arising out of or in connection with the performance of the Services or the acts, errors and/or 
omissions of Consultant and/or the Professional Parties; 
F. 
any claims under workers’ compensation acts and other employee benefit acts, including without limitation, with respect to 
Consultant’s employees or the employees of the Professional Parties, or any of them, arising out of or in connection with this 
Agreement or the performance of the Services; 
G. 
Consultant’s failure to fulfill its obligations under this Agreement in strict accordance with its terms, including Consultant’s breach of 
any representations or covenants given in this Agreement or elsewhere by Consultant; and/or 
H. 
Violation of any local, state or federal Laws by Consultant and/or any of the Professional Parties. 
I. 
Notwithstanding the foregoing, Consultant shall not be obligated to indemnify the Indemnified Parties to the extent such Liability 
arises from the negligence or willful misconduct of the party sought to be indemnified or agents, servants or independent 
contractors, who are directly responsible to the party sought to be indemnified, or for defects in design furnished by such persons. It 
is the parties’ intent that Consultant’s indemnification obligations shall apply to damages arising from the negligent acts, errors 
and/or omissions of Consultant and/or the Professional Parties. 
J. 
The Indemnified Parties’ rights to indemnification hereunder shall be independent of the Indemnified Parties rights under the 
insurance to be provided under Section V hereof. Nothing in this indemnification provision shall be construed to limit or alter any of 
the other obligations of Consultant under this Agreement or otherwise, including, without limitation, Consultant’s insurance 
obligations pursuant to Section V of this Agreement or otherwise. 
