BC 
From: Nelson Investments Inc.
 

page 1 of 3
 
 
 
937 View Street, Victoria, BC 
 
RFP Closing: July 15th , 2019 at 1:00PM 
 
INTRODUCTION 
 
Nelson Investments Inc. (the “Owner”) intends to develop a site located at 937 View Street in Victoria. 
The Owner intends to redevelop the site by constructing a 15-storey rental tower with ground level 
parking and one level of below grade, housing storage and service rooms, (the “Project”). 
A revised development permit application is intended to be submitted shortly to the City of Victoria 
shortly and the Structural Engineer (the “Consultant”) to provide consulting services for the Project. 
The Owner invites proponents (“Proponents”) to respond to this Request for Proposals (“RFP”) for the 
services described in this RFP by submitting a proposal in accordance with this RFP (a “Proposal”). 
 
THE PROJECT 
 
This 16,924 square foot site is located on the northwest side of View Street mid-block between 
Vancouver St. and Quadra Street in the City of Victoria. The proposed new development which has a 
gross floor area of approximately 124,201 square feet (including FSR exclusion areas) plus one level of 
underground storage/service space will be a 15 storey building (one more than the architectural 
drawings show) comprised of a concrete structure up to the 2nd floor and a combination of concrete or 
structural steel core and load bearing light gauge steel for the remainder of the structure up to L15. 
The Owner seeks to develop a residential rental tower comprising of a total of 253 units with small 
number of unit types, with limited parking on the ground floor that fronts onto View Street. 
Schematic design is ongoing and the development permit package is being prepared to be submitted to 
the City. The Owner intends to commence construction in Q2 of 2020. 
 
SCOPE OF WORK 
 
The Owner is requesting Proposals for Structural Engineering services for the Project (the 
“Services”) to be performed by the Consultant. The intent of this RFP is to have the firms under 
consideration specifically address the services required and provide a well-considered price 
proposal for those services. 
Please note The Owner is looking for a value engineered approach to the project. 
 
 
 

