Administrator or by the persons or entities signing this Agreement on behalf of 
the Owner. The Owner hereby designates its Project Administrator to be 
Alison Mills. 
 
III. 
Standard of Services, Representation 
 
 
The Services will be performed by the Consultant in a professional manner in 
accordance with the practices, procedures and standards prevailing among reputable and 
recognized structural engineers from academia experienced in performing similar services. 
The Consultant represents and warrants to the Owner: (a) that the employees of the 
Consultant who are performing or will perform the Services, or any portion thereof, are, and 
shall be throughout the term of this Agreement, fully qualified, licensed as required, and 
skilled to perform the Services; and (b) that the Services furnished by Consultant hereunder 
shall meet the requirements set forth herein and in the Project documents and shall conform to 
any and all other applicable requirements furnished by the Owner, by others at the Owner's 
direction or request, to Consultant during the term of this Agreement or applicable testing 
agency. 
 
IV. 
Payment For Services. 
 
 
A. 
The Owner shall pay the Consultant the amount specified on Exhibit A as full 
and complete payment for the Services rendered and to be rendered by the Consultant 
pursuant to this Agreement, which amount includes all labor, costs and expenses incurred or 
to be incurred by the Consultant in connection with its performance of its Services. The 
Consultant’s Fee shall not exceed the amount specified on Exhibit A unless (1) cause is"
