46bfe9f4e084,30950-01,30950-01,Wesgroup Properties Ltd.,59th & Cambie @ 7525 Cambie St,client,draft,3/7,,2020-11-18,projects,Projects\Projects\03 Residential\30950-01 (59th & Cambie - 7525 Cambie St)\01 General\Proposals & Contracts\30950-01 2020-11-18 - Kor Structural -  PSA.pdf,,2.2,"Invoices.  Prior to the 25th of each month, the Consultant will prepare and submit to the Owner a",payment,104,"2.2 Invoices. Prior to the 25th of each month, the Consultant will prepare and submit to the Owner a 
detailed invoice of fees and pre-authorized expenses. The invoice will include a work summary broken 
down by ‘Services Category’ as shown in Schedule “B” – Compensation, and include columns for the 
amount, percentage of the ‘Services Category’ complete, the previous month’s invoice amount, total 
amount invoiced to date, the amount remaining and current invoice amount. All invoices will be provided 
with evidence substantiating time spent and expenses incurred. 
GST will be set out as a separate line item on any invoice submitted by the Consultant."
46bfe9f4e084,30950-01,30950-01,Wesgroup Properties Ltd.,59th & Cambie @ 7525 Cambie St,client,draft,3/7,,2020-11-18,projects,Projects\Projects\03 Residential\30950-01 (59th & Cambie - 7525 Cambie St)\01 General\Proposals & Contracts\30950-01 2020-11-18 - Kor Structural -  PSA.pdf,,2.3,"Timesheets.  If requested by the Owner, the Consultant will deliver timesheets for all employees",assignment_subconsultants,24,"2.3 Timesheets. If requested by the Owner, the Consultant will deliver timesheets for all employees 
of the Consultant and of any subconsultant performing Services."
46bfe9f4e084,30950-01,30950-01,Wesgroup Properties Ltd.,59th & Cambie @ 7525 Cambie St,client,draft,3/7,,2020-11-18,projects,Projects\Projects\03 Residential\30950-01 (59th & Cambie - 7525 Cambie St)\01 General\Proposals & Contracts\30950-01 2020-11-18 - Kor Structural -  PSA.pdf,,2.4,Payment. The following will apply with respect to payment of an invoice:,termination|payment,160,"2.4 Payment. The following will apply with respect to payment of an invoice: 
(a) 
Following the receipt of an invoice from the Consultant, the Owner will make its own 
determination of whether the invoice is payable in the amount indicated. For invoices received 
prior to or on the 25th of a month, payment will become due on the last day of the following 
month. Invoices received after the 25th of a month will not be processed for payment until the 
following month and payment will become due on the last day of the second month after receipt 
of the invoice. 
(b) 
If the Owner does not agree with the invoice or portion of an invoice, the Owner will review the 
invoice with the Consultant. If the invoice cannot be resolved between the Owner and the 
Consultant, the Owner will pay the portion the Owner determines is owing and will include with 
the payment an explanation for any such invoice reduction."
