Enclosed is our fee proposal for structural engineering services for the above noted project. The project is 
described in your email received March 4,2025 
 
Project Description 
 
Our scope of structural engineering services includes the following: 
 
 Review the floor load design and advise from a structural point of view. 
 Review of the proposed tenant improvement for any impacts on the base building structure as 
requested by owner/architect. 
 It includes the base building improvement of the slab to meet the loading requirements. 
 It includes 20 inspections. 
 Preparation of a written report, if required. 
 
The proposed fixed fees for our services are $12,000. 
 
Upon acceptance of the proposed fees, we require a retainer of $2,000, prior to commencement of services. 
The retainer will be applied to the final invoice 
 
ln addition to the above fixed fee, we propose to charge for any additional services outside the original 
scope of work on an hourly rates basis in accordance to Appendix A Hourly Charge Out Rates. 
 
Please note that we carry sufficient professional liability insurance. 
 
Summary of Typical Services and Exclusions 
 
Our services would not include any of the following:"
