We understand the façade of the existing building will be retained and integrated with the new 
structure. Our fees will include for all design, details, and coordination required for the retention of 
this façade. Our fee does not include for any of the following items: 
 
a. 
Temporary shoring and bracing of the existing façade. 
b. 
