Project Personnel & Experience 
 
The Senior Structural Designer and principal contact for this project will be Jason Stuart, who has more 
than 20 years of experience in the design of low to mid-rise wood-frame and concrete buildings. Jason 
actively leads the growing specialized wood-frame team at KOR where he shares his extensive structural 
design experience and thorough knowledge of various materials on multiple projects. Jason is a 
seasoned structural designer and project manager who goes above and beyond to support project 
milestones, maintain open lines of communication between all stakeholders, and carefully supervises all 
phase of his projects from preliminary design through construction and project completion. 
 
After the initial stages of design are complete, Jason Stuart will be assisted by Sadi Ghaffari, who brings 
over 15 years of drafting and design experience and a thorough knowledge of steel and concrete design 
to his role as Structural Designer at Kor Structural. 
 
Additional staff dedicated to this project will include: 
 
 Conor Murtagh, B.A.Sc., P.L.Eng. 
 Kate Reid, B.A.Sc., EIT 
 Nelson Yu, Structural CAD Technologist 
 
All personnel listed have extensive experience with similar projects. 
 
Included with this proposal is an illustrated sample of some of our most recent projects. For further 
information on key project personnel and an introduction to Kor Structural, please visit our website at 
www.korstructural.com. 
 
