REQUEST FOR PROPOSAL TO PROVIDE STRUCTURAL ENGINEERING SERVICES 
 
 
We are pleased to invite you to submit a proposal to provide structural engineering services for a new 54-
storey rental housing project. Outlined below is a summary of the specifics associated with this site. The 
submission deadline is July 07, 2021. 
 
General Project Description 
 
The project site area is approximately 96,848 sf, resulting in approx. 309,705 sf FAR of Market Condos 
and 126,886 sf FAR of market rental and 19,287 sf FAR of non-market rental. The site slopes up from North 
to South at 4.7% along Gardena and 1.6% along Claremont. The average cross fall along the East West 
connector road is 10.7% with a grade difference of 27 ft on the East side. The static groundwater table is 
expected to be within the range of 24 to 33 ft below existing grades. 
 
As part of the Oakdale Land Use Concept, a future Collector Road connecting Gardena Dr. to Claremont St 
has been identified and will require an East West dedication through our site. The estimated dedication 
width is 70.5ft. Additional 10ft x 10ft dedications are also required for corner cuts along the new E-W 
Collector Road. The E/W collector road divides the site into two parcels: roughly 50,879 sf on the North and 
31,506 sf on the South. 
 
The development strategy is to fit the majority of the density on the North parcel and the balance on the 
South, allowing us to minimize the depth of excavation and to complete construction sooner on the smaller 
parcel. 
 
The form of development for the strata condos will be a ±42 storey concrete tower in the park with a floor plate 
of 7,600 sf located on the North end of the site, and a ±13 storey concrete tower in the park with a 7,525 sf 
floor plate on the South end of the site. The Rental will be two 6 storey woodframe buildings; one on the North 
site and one on the South. The bottom 3 floors of the South rental building will be below market rental. 6 
storey buildings on RM6 sites are not required to step back above the fourth floor. We anticipate 5.5 levels of 
underground parking on the North parcel and 2.5 levels on the South. No underground parking below the 

Gardena & Claremont | June 22, 2021 
 
 
 
