INTRACORP.CA 
 
Collector road dedication. Given the slope of the site, we anticipate a significant amount of terracing from East 
to West. 
 
Coquitlam requires approximately 54sf of amenities per dwelling unit. The majority of the amenities will be 
provided as outdoor spaces on the roof tops of the rental buildings. 
 
 
