Third Party Warranty 
This development will be registered with a third-party warranty provider. The selected consultant will have to 
review and satisfy such warranty requirements and provide a Certificate of Insurance upon execution of the 
Consulting Services Agreement. 
 
Strata Property Act (British Columbia) 
We are required to comply with Section 20 of the Strata Property Act (BC), which includes provision of 
drawings, permits, and other similar information related to the project at the First Annual General Meeting of 
the Strata Corporation. We ask that you support us in meeting these requirements where applicable. 
 
