As you know, we have been asked by Cast Development LLC to provide additional services for Precast Coordination and various structural changes as follows. 

Precast Coordination: (proposed fee = $15,000)
Columns have been moved inboard to provide clearance for exterior precast at many locations over the height of the tower.
Slab redesign and addition of post tensioning required to accommodate tight deflection tolerance for exterior precast at many levels in the tower.
Design and detailing of additional intermediate structural supports for the precast at level 1.
Attendance at weekly precast coordination meetings.
Slab step coordination and changes to suit precast requirements.

MEP Changes: (proposed fee = $5,000)
Fire Water tank and pump room revisions at foundation 
Addition of Sand Oil Interceptor and Sump and resulting foundation revisions
Addition of Grease interceptor platform and ground floor slab modifications to suit.
Addition of heavy plumbing tanks at roof and resulting roof slab changes.

Our total proposed fee for these additional services is $20,000.

In order to keep the project on schedule - we have proceeded with this work in good faith.

Please return a signed copy of this proposal with your approval.

