12. All rights and remedies herein conferred may be exercised whether or not foreclosure proceedings are pending under the Security Instrument or any other action or proceeding has been commenced under any of the other Loan Documents. Administrative Agent shall not be required to resort first to the security of this Assignment before resorting to the security of the Security Instrument or any of the other Loan Documents and Administrative Agent may exercise the security hereof or thereof concurrently or independently and in any order of preference.
13. Failure of Administrative Agent to avail itself of any of the terms, covenants, and conditions of this Assignment for any period of time, or at any time or times, shall not be construed or deemed to be a waiver of any of its rights hereunder. The rights and remedies of Administrative Agent under this Assignment are cumulative and are not in lieu of, but are in addition to, any other rights and remedies which Administrative Agent shall have under or by virtue of the Loan Documents or Assignor’s obligations to Administrative Agent and the Lenders thereunder. The rights and remedies of Administrative Agent hereunder may be exercised from time to time and as often as such exercise is deemed expedient by Administrative Agent.
14. Assignor agrees that upon any sale or transfer by Administrative Agent and the Lenders of the Loan Documents and the indebtedness evidenced thereby that is permitted by the Loan Agreement, or upon any person acquiring the Property or any interest therein that is permitted by the Loan Agreement, Administrative Agent may deliver to the purchaser or transferee the Engineer Agreement and may assign to such purchaser or transferee the rights of Administrative Agent hereunder, who shall thereupon become vested with all powers and rights given to Administrative Agent and the Lenders in respect thereto (and subject to Administrative Agent’s obligations hereunder), and Administrative Agent and the Lenders shall be forever relieved and fully discharged from any liability or responsibility thereafter accruing in connection therewith. In no event shall Administrative Agent be liable with respect to, or on account of, the Engineer Agreement, except for the safekeeping of any instruments delivered to Administrative Agent pursuant hereto, and Administrative Agent shall specifically have no obligation to enforce any rights against any contractor, or grantor or issuer.
15. Upon full payment and performance of the obligations and liabilities set forth or contained in this Assignment and the other Loan Documents (excluding only any contingent indemnification obligations which survive full indefeasible repayment of the Loan) and simultaneously with the discharge of the Security Instrument, this Assignment shall become and be void and of no effect and, in that event, upon the request of Assignor, Administrative Agent covenants to execute and deliver to Assignor instruments effective to evidence the termination of this Assignment and the reassignment (without recourse) to Assignor of such rights and interests in the Engineer Agreement and the rights, title, interest, power and authority assigned herein; provided, however, that any affidavit, certificate or other written statement of any officer of Administrative Agent stating that any part of said indebtedness remains unpaid shall be and constitute conclusive evidence of the then validity, effectiveness and continuing force of this Assignment and any person, firm, or corporation receiving any such affidavit, certificate or statement may, and is hereby authorized to rely thereon."
