Consultant agrees to provide all transportation, labor, services, materials, equipment, shop and offices, and other items necessary and sufficient to complete Services as set forth below, all in strict accordance with Agreement and in accordance with and pursuant to the following:

Our proposed fees are based on the following project specifications:
20-story residential development, including:
Level 1 – lobby, reception, parking
Rooftop amenity and pool
207 studio, one-bedroom & two-bedroom units Total FAR of 15.1 and FAR area of 150,660 sq.ft.
Built over one level of below grade parking.

The estimated breakdown is as follows:
Residential Market Condominiums: (144,690 sq.ft. GFA)
Total Parking Area : (14,330 sq.ft. GFA)
Lobby, Amenity & service areas (7,280 sq.ft. GFA) Total Gross Floor Area GFA (including parking) : (166,300 sq.ft. GFA)

All preliminary work and preliminary consultations with the Architect will be charged on an hourly basis in accordance with the attached list of hourly charge out rates, however, please note that all charges for preliminary work are included in the above fixed fees.

The proposed fixed fees include our time to travel to California four (4) times during the design phases (1. through 4.) to meet with building officials, architects, and others as needed. Also, our proposed fixed fees allow for 6 site visits during the Construction Review Phase for Code required structural observations.

Over and above the noted fixed fees, we will invoice monthly for normal disbursements such as: travel expenses, courier costs, external printing, and plotting, etc. We propose an additional fee of $1,200 USD per trip to cover travel expenses. This flat fee for travel expenses will be split between other projects in the area as appropriate.

