First & Beech, San Diego California, USA 
Tower Crane Foundation 
 
Kor Reference Number: 31005-01 X.4 03 
 
This is an addendum to our original fee proposal for structural engineering services for the First & Beech 
project located in San Diego, California. (the “Project”). 
 
As you know, we have been asked to provide structural design services for the tower crane foundations. 
These are additional services were outlined in our original fee proposal, Appendix B, dated September 17, 
2021, along with the associated design fees. 
 
Our fees for these extra services are: 
 
• 
Tower Crane Foundation (excluding mast tieback components) $10,000 
 
All other Scope of Structural Engineering Services and Summary of Typical Services and Exclusions remain 
as per our original September 17, 2021, fee proposal. 
 
Approval to Proceed: 
 
We have proceeded with this work in good faith, however request that a signed copy of this fee proposal is 
returned to us. If you have any questions or need additional information, please contact the undersigned. 
 
We propose to invoice monthly. It is our policy to state that we reserve the right to discontinue our work if 
the client fails to meet his commitments, and we will not be responsible for any damages arising therefrom. 
 
We trust the foregoing proposal meets your expectations. Feel free to call me to discuss this if necessary. 
 
 
 

