F. 
Consultant assumes full and exclusive responsibility and liability for withholding and paying, as may be required by law, any and 
all federal, state and local taxes, and contributions, with respect to or assessed against, or measured by Consultant’s earnings 
under this Agreement, or the salaries or compensation of Consultant’s principals and other personnel, or other contributions for 
which Consultant may be responsible under federal, state and local laws. Consultant shall file any and all returns or other 
