G. 
Any and all Services to be provided under the Agreement by Consultant, its principals, employees and agents shall be performed 
as an independent contractor, and not as an employee or agent of Company. Nothing in this Agreement shall constitute or be 
construed to create a partnership, joint venture, principal-agent or employer-employee relationship between the Company and 
Consultant. In rendering Services under this Agreement, the Consultant will control the operation of its Services and will"
