K23-028 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
Kinetica will attend three site visits; typically these include a site visit to the steel fabrication facility of VCD 
connecting elements or site visits during the installation of VCD connecting elements and installation of the 
VE damper panels at the building site. 
 
 
Required Information 
 
Kinetica requires the following information to complete its scope of work. 
 
From EOR: 
 
 
Service Level Wind, Ultimate Level Wind and seismic ETABS models with the latest architectural and 
structural modifications. If any tangible structural changes are made an update of the structural models. 
 
From Wind Tunnel: 
 
 
Assessment of level of damping required to meet acceleration criteria based on the latest structural model 
by EOR. If ULS load reduction from damping is desired it is suggested to obtain wind tunnel time-history 
loads with the development of a full-storm duration and scaling factors to establish the final design VE 
material properties."
