VCD Performance Assessment - $13,000

Quality Control and Site Review - $10,000

If the VCD becomes unviable on the project and Kinetica design services are no longer required, Kinetica we will immediately issue a final invoice to Bosa Developments for the work up to date and immediately stop working on the project. 



