Dear Mahdieh: 

Re: Addendum to Fee Proposal – Design of a strip footing (substructure) for the perimeter fencing and the trellises and of the helical screw piles supporting the bench
 Little Mountain Building AB, 150 East 36th Avenue, Vancouver, B.C
 Kor Reference Number: 31045-01X.3 03

This is an addendum to our original fee proposal for structural engineering services for the Little Mountain Building AB, 150 East 36th Avenue, Vancouver, BC (the “Project”). Our original fee proposal dated February 15, 2022 assumed the Project comprised a 6-storey mixed-use commercial/residential development including approximately 48 social housing units built over 1 level of below grade parking structure.

Additional structural work is required for the design of the substructures of the perimeter fence and some trellises, as well as helical screw piles to support the bench.

