Kor Structural has a good working relationship with Ciccozzi Architecture and we have worked on 
numerous projects together over the past 20 years. We have more than 5 current projects with Ciccozzi 
Architecture and a few of our most recently completed projects include the Kiwanis Affordable Housing 
Towers located 6291 Minoru Boulevard, Richmond, B.C. (with Polygon Homes); 1123 Westwood Street, 
Coquitlam, B.C. (with Onni Group); 7791 & 7811 Alderbridge Way, Richmond, B.C. (with Hungerford 
Properties); and Villo located at 7011-7087 MacPherson Avenue & 5558 Short Street, Burnaby, B.C. (with 
