Scope of Structural Services 
 
Our scope of services includes detailed coordination with the Architect and other consultants, as well as 
developing the project in AutoCAD. We will assist the Architect in completing Schematic Design 
Documents along with providing local technical expertise and participate in local engineering/sub-
consultant coordination in support of this phase of the work. Sketches of the structure will be provided, 
defining dimensions of the structure in detail, so Architect's drawings can reflect real structural member 
sizes. Preliminary drawings of the structure will be provided in sufficient detail for preliminary pricing of the 
structure. The preliminary structure will be coordinated with the needs of the Architect and other 
consultants (mechanical and electrical). Based on the DP submission, we will create, and coordinate 
construction documentation (drawings and specifications) as required to issue for tender, building permit 
and construction. We will coordinate with the Architect and other consultants in the development of the 
construction documentation. We are able to change structure as needed to meet final needs of Architect 
and other consultants and keep the structure on budget, as well as to incorporate the recommendations 
of any specialist consultants if required. 
 
The foregoing proposed fees are for normal basic structural engineering services as follows:"
