Project Description 
 
Our proposed fees are based on the following assumptions: 
 
 Project comprises of 2-phased mixed-use residential/commercial towers ranging from 32 to 39-
storeys in height spread across two podiums. 
 Phase 1 East Tower: 32-storeys in height including approximately 317 residential units gross floor 
area calculated to be 309,872 sq.ft. 
 Phase 2 
o 
West Tower: 36-storeys in height including approximately 319 residential units. 
o 
Mid Tower: 39-storeys in height including approximately 345 residential units. 
o 
Phase 2 includes approximately 664 residential units gross floor area is calculated to be 
650,362 sq.ft. 
 The project includes approximately 981 residential units total including studio, penthouses, 1, 2, 
and 3-bedroom homes +/- den, retail and amenity space. 
 All to be built over 3 levels of below grade shared parking structure. 
 The total gross buildable area for the above is estimated to be 960,234 sq.ft. and the estimated 
breakdown is as follows: 
o 
Phase 1 Total FSR: 309,872 sq.ft. gross calculated area. 
o 
Phase 2 total FSR: 650,362 sq.ft. gross calculated area. 
o 
Retail, Service and Amenity: 98,268 sq.ft. gross calculated area (included in total FSR) 
o 
Parking: 434,886 sq.ft. gross calculated area. 
 We understand the proposed timeline/milestone dates to be as follows: 
o 
Building Permit Submission: March 2025 
o 
Construction Start on Phase1: December 2025 
o 
Construction Start on Phase 2a and 2b: December 2026 
o 
Expected construction timeline: 54 months 
 
The below fixed fees are based on 1,395,120 sq.ft. of structural area. 
 
 
 

