OUR COMPANY 
The Firm 
Headquartered in Vancouver, B.C., with satellite offices in Kelowna and Nanaimo, Kor Structural (""KOR"") provides 
structural engineering, consultation, design, and inspection services throughout British Columbia and across North 
America. We specialize in delivering efficient, creative, and buildable solutions for projects of all sizes and types, 
including residential, commercial, institutional, and light industrial structures. Our expertise spans all forms of 
concrete, structural steel, wood-frame, and masonry. 
Founded over 25 years ago by three seasoned professional engineers, KOR has grown to a team of 40+ 
professionals committed to superior client service, innovative design, and quality execution. 
Every project begins with a solid foundation, and KOR combines first-class structural engineering expertise, 
technological innovation, and a steadfast commitment to supporting your design team. 
Our Services 
At KOR, structural engineering is a harmonious blend of creative design and practical solutions, guided by rigorous 
discipline and adherence to engineering principles and codes. Our services include: 
• 
Design of high-rise reinforced concrete structures 
• 
Performance-based structural analysis and design 
• 
Analysis and design of unique, complex structural systems using materials such as reinforced concrete, 
structural steel, heavy timber, and masonry 
• 
Dedicated wood-frame design department 
Our integrated engineering, drafting, and construction teams utilize agile workflows, ensuring designs that are 
innovative, compliant, and cost-effective. Our goal is to deliver exceptional work while being easy to collaborate 
with. 
Our Commitment To Quality 
We adhere to gold-standard operating systems and organizational quality management practices, including: 
• 
Rigorous quality control aligned with Professional Quality Management Guidelines, involving Independent 
engineering reviews by professional engineers not involved in the project design 
• 
A well-defined project workflow with standardized policies and procedures 
• 
Continuous improvement practices to enhance consistency and efficiency 
Our dedication to quality ensures that every project meets the highest standards of professionalism and reliability. 

 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
