 Heatherlands Parcel B, Vancouver, BC
 Additional Structural Engineering Services – Schematic Design Iterations
 Kor Reference Number: 31097-01X.2 02

As you know, we have been asked by Aquilini Group to provide additional structural engineering services for the schematic re-design of the Heather Lands B three tower project over shared underground parking.

Going back to August of 2023 we have provided many iterations of the schematic structural design for this project. Since that date we have prepared and submitted schematic design drawings to the Architect on 10 separate occasions. We also recently received further updated Architectural Plans on Oct 27, 2025 which will require further schematic design review for the structure.

As we discussed with you recently, during schematic design we expect to have some iterations of the structural design required as part of our coordination with the Architectural drawings, however for this project we have been required to cycle through this design process many more times than we had budgeted in our original fee proposal.

We proposed to increase the fee budget for Schematic Design to account for these additional schematic design services.

Our proposed fee for these additional services is $32,000.

Please return a signed copy of this proposal with your approval.

We expect to bill for these services in our next monthly billing cycles as the work is completed.

We trust the above information is satisfactory, please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions.


Yours truly,

Kor Structural
