This is an addendum to our original fee proposal for structural engineering services for the above noted 
project. 
 
Based on recent architectural revisions received from WNDR Architecture on June 17, 2026, additional 
structural redesign and drafting work will be required. 
 
The scope of work covered under this addendum includes: 
 
Concrete Structural Revisions 
• 
Redesign and drafting of foundations at Parking Levels P2 and P1. 
• 
Redesign and drafting of suspended slab to slab-on-grade transition at Parking Level P1. 
• 
Redesign and drafting of slab band support at Parking Level P1 to accommodate relocated parking 
column location. 
• 
Redesign and drafting of basement walls as required. 
 
Wood Frame Structural Revisions 
• 
Redesign and drafting of roof framing to suit revised roof deck layouts. 
• 
Redesign and drafting of framing and transfers elements at Levels 5 and 6 to suit revised 
Architectural layouts. 
 
We propose an additional fixed fee of $8,000 for the above scope of work. 
 
All other Scope of Structural Engineering Services and Summary of Typical Services and Exclusions remain 
as per our original fee proposal. 
 
Upon receipt of authorization to proceed, we will need approximately one week to complete the redesign 
and drafting associated with the revised concrete structure. The wood frame revisions will be completed 
later, after Architectural unit changes have been finalized and updated drawings received. 
 
 
 

