This is our fee proposal for structural engineering services for the above noted project. The project is 
shown on TKA+D Architecture’s preliminary drawings dated March 22, 2022, provided to us with your 
request for proposal email received October 13, 2023 
 
Project Description 
 
Our proposed fees are based on the following assumptions: 
 
 Two 6-storey wood-frame purpose-built rental buildings with approximately 300 university housing 
units, amenity areas, and commercial space, over one level of below grade parking structure. 
 Buildings A and B are estimated to have a total gross floor area of 237,192 sq.ft. and a total 
proposed FSR area of 224,318 sq.ft. (1.75 FSR) 
 The total structural area for the above, including slab on grade, is estimated to be 298,000 sq.ft. 
 The following fee is based on approximately 218,000 sq.ft. of structural design area. 
 We understand the proposed timeline/milestone dates to be as follows: 
o 
Development Permit submission: January 2024 
o 
Stage 2 Building Permit Submission: March 2025 
o 
Construction start: October 2025 
o 
Occupancy/Completion: April 2027 
 
Proposed Fees 
 
The following fees are for complete structural engineering services for the project as noted in the 
following Scope of Structural Services. The proposed fixed fees for our services are as follows:"
