The coordination of sustainable design strategies and energy efficient design between all disciplines will be required – This 
project will be pursuing Step Code 2 + Zero Carbon Step Code (ZCSC) or alternative pathway as per the District of West 
Vancouver requirements. If applicable, a high-level cost-benefit analysis of how this impacts a holistic strategy as 
well as Strata Maintenance costs should be reviewed based on the attached Beedie-proposed sustainability 
framework in Exhibit E. 
