should its status change. 
 
(b) 
Unless stated otherwise, the amounts payable by the Owner to the Consultant pursuant to this 
Agreement do not include any Sales Tax. The Consultant is responsible to determine whether it 
has the obligation to be registered and if tax is applicable under this Agreement. To the extent 
Sales Tax is payable by the Owner, the Consultant shall collect the relevant taxes from the Owner 
at the time the Consultant issues its invoice for the consideration payable and shall separately 
