(a) 
if applicable Work is Completed as of the date of termination and not yet paid by the Owner, the 
Consultant shall have the right to payment for a portion of the Price equivalent to the reasonable 
value of the Work Completed prior to the date of termination, provided that an invoice shall be 
delivered to the Owner within 30 days of the date of termination and such payment shall be due 
after 60 days of the date of an undisputed invoice; and 
 
(b) 
if applicable Work is not Completed as of the date of termination, the Consultant is entitled to 
receive compensation in connection with its work-in-progress accrued prior to the date of 
