be non-contributing with, and shall apply only as primary and not excess to any other insurance available to the additional insureds;

provide that it shall not be cancelled, or its coverage reduced, except upon 30 days prior notice (by registered mail) to the Owner; and

include a waiver of subrogation rights only to the comprehensive general liability insurance which the insurer might otherwise have against the Owner, its directors, trustees, officers, employees, or agents."
