The Consultant reserves all right, title, and interest in and to works created by it in the process of carrying out is obligation under this Agreement, including all copyrights, patents, and other intellectual property rights. Notwithstanding the foregoing, the Owner shall have an irrevocable, royalty-free license to use the Records in perpetuity for the project for which the Owner has chosen to retain the Consultant pursuant to this Agreement. The Consultant shall ensure that its agreements with its consultants and other third parties contain a similar provision in order to ensure that the Owner has such license. The Consultant represents, warrants and covenants that this license does not infringe on the rights of any third party. The Consultant may rescind the license only if the Owner has failed to make payment for the Work relating to the Records when due. If the Consultant elects to rescind the license it must first provide written notice to the Owner. Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this paragraph, if:

there is an unsettled dispute regarding the Owner’s unpaid invoice for the Work as it relates to this Records; or

the Owner responds to the Consultant’s notice to rescind the license within 30 business days with a notification of dispute,

then the Consultant’s right to revoke the Owner’s license will be delayed until the dispute is definitively settled or ruled upon by a court of competent jurisdiction.

MISCELLANEOUS

Entire Agreement

This Agreement and any subsequent amendment hereto or restatement hereof constitutes the entire agreement between the parties hereto pertaining to the subject matter hereof and supersedes all prior agreements, understandings, negotiations and discussions, whether oral or written, of the parties hereto, and there are no warranties, conditions, representations or other agreements between the parties in connection with the subject matter hereof except as contained in this Agreement and any subsequent amendment hereto.

