independent contractor and not as an employee, agent, partner, joint venturer, or dependent 
contractor of the Owner. 
 
(b) 
The Consultant agrees to perform during the Term, directly or indirectly, the Completion of all Work 
in accordance with this Agreement, and all matters in relation thereto, including but not limited to 
the following functions: 
 
(i) 
coordinate, supervise, and manage the planning for the Work; 
 
(ii) 
arrange for, and supervise each Service Provider’s performance of any function relating to 
the Work; 
 
(iii) 
review all material prepared and submitted by Service Providers; 
 
