Work in accordance with this Agreement, and all matters in relation thereto, including but not
limited to the following functions:
(i)
coordinate, supervise, and manage the planning for the Work;
(ii)
(i) arrange for, and supervise each Service Provider’s performance of any function
relating to the Work;
