CONSULTANT FUNCTIONS
Functions

The Owner hereby engages the Consultant, and the Consultant hereby agrees to act, as an independent contractor of the Owner to Complete the work described in this Agreement for the Property (hereinafter collectively referred to as the “Work”) during the Term, subject to the terms, conditions and limitations set out in this Agreement. The Consultant is, and shall be, acting as an independent contractor and not as an employee, agent, partner, joint venturer, or dependent contractor of the Owner.

