The Consultant acknowledges having read the measures and procedures relating to occupational and workplace health and safety as prescribed by Applicable Laws, iThe Consultant acknowledges and understands its duties as set out therein and hereby expressly and agrees to comply with all such requirements and standards in their entirety and at its sole expense unless stated otherwise herein or otherwise agreed by the parties hereto in advance in writing. In addition, the Consultant agrees to fully co-operate with all health and safety programs, rules, regulations, standards and criteria set or instituted by the Owner as set out in the Starlight Vendor Policy or referenced herein, which agreement may be in furtherance of those under Applicable Laws."
