Project Description 
Our proposed fees are based on the following assumptions: 
• 
Project involves a 20-storey concrete tower, and a 6-storey woodframe development built over 3 levels of 
underground parking. 
o 
20-storey tower includes approximately 196 units with a reported gross buildable area of 
138,624 sq.ft. plus additional underground parking (185,500 sq. ft. calculated structural area) 
o 
6-storey wood frame includes approximately 137 units with a reported gross buildable area of 
97,887 sq.ft. plus additional underground parking. (174,500 sq. ft. calculated structural area) 
• 
The project includes approximately 333 residential units total including studio, 1, 2, and 3-bedroom 
homes +/- den. 
• 
163 new parking spaces. 
• 
The proposed development aims to achieve a reported 236,511 sq. ft. of total buildable area. 
• 
The total calculated structural area taken from the submitted drawings is 360,000 sq,ft including parking, 
amenity, roof and other structural areas. 
