We adhere to gold-standard operating systems and organizational quality management practices, including: 
• 
Rigorous quality control aligned with EGBC’s Quality Management Guidelines, involving engineering 
reviews by independent professional engineers 
• 
A well-defined project workflow with standardized policies and procedures 
• 
Continuous improvement practices to enhance consistency and efficiency 
Our dedication to quality ensures that every project meets the highest standards of professionalism and reliability. 
Technological Excellence 
To remain at the forefront of the industry, we leverage both legacy and cutting-edge technologies. Our tools 
include: 
• 
3D seismic analysis software (ETABS, PERFORM3D) 
• 
Finite element slab design tools (RAM Concept, SAFE) 
• 
Space frame structural analysis tools (STAAD, RAM Steel) 
• 
BIM software (Revit, A360) 
• 
2D drafting tools (AutoCAD) 
Our custom-built internal collaboration dashboard enables seamless project execution, supported by a dedicated 
IT department focused on continuous system optimization. 
Project Personnel and Experience 
Project Manager: 
Jim DesRoches, P.Eng., PE 
A licensed professional engineer in British Columbia, Alberta, Ontario, and Washington, Jim brings over 30 years of 
experience in structural design and quality management, as well as more than 20 years’ experience designing, 
permitting, and directing construction of projects in Southern California. His collaborative and client-focused 
approach ensures creative solutions tailored to project needs. 
Engineer of Record: 
John Markulin, M.Eng., P.Eng. Struct.Eng., PE, SE 
