Sales Tax 

The Consultant represents, warrants and agrees that it is registered under Part IX of the Excise Tax Act (Canada) for the collection and remittance of Canada’s Goods and Services Tax (“GST”) and any Harmonized Sales Tax (“HST”) or any other provincial sales taxes applicable to any services performed by the Consultant hereunder (collectively, “Sales Tax”), and that it will remain registered for Sales Tax during the Term of this Agreement or shall otherwise notify the Owner should its status change."
