Upon an Event of Default of the Consultant pursuant to this Agreement that, if capable of being cured, is not cured within 15 days following written notice to the Consultant from the Owner specifying in reasonable detail the nature of the Event of Default, the Owner may terminate this Agreement without prejudice to its rights to pursue all legal and equitable remedies."
