The Consultant shall not make or permit the making of any public announcement regarding the Work, this Agreement, or its connection with the Owner without the Owner’s prior written express consent. 
Assignment

This Agreement may not be assigned by the Consultant without the prior written consent of the Owner, which consent may be withheld by the Owner. 

Successors and Assigns

This Agreement shall be binding upon and shall enure to the benefit of the parties hereto and their respective successors and permitted assigns. Whenever the terms “Owner” and “Consultant” are used herein, they shall be deemed to mean and include the Owner and the Consultant and their respective successors and permitted assigns in the same manner and to the same extent as if specified each time said terms appear herein.

Survival

The obligations of the Consultant, including those set out in Sections 4.1, 4.4, 5.2(c), 7.4, 7.5, 7.6, 8.1, 8.2, 8.3, 9.3, and Article 10, hereof, shall not merge upon but shall survive the expiration or sooner termination of this Agreement.

