Value Added Taxes, of Reimbursable Expenses that may become payable for each item. Except where Reimbursable 
Expenses are indicated as payable on an “E3” basis, the Consultant does not represent nor warrant that the 
Reimbursable Expenses will be less than or equal to the probable costs indicated.
