As indicated in Appendix 3, all proposals must include a breakdown of fees by scope stage. 
BIM Modeling Guidelines 
Whitetail requests that all proposals include allowances for BIM-coordination between the Consultant 
and the Coordinating Professional / Architect. Please include separate pricing for BIM modeling at the 
Consultant’s recommended LOD (“Level of Detail/Development”), and pricing for BIM modeling at a 300-
LOD1 for all project elements. 
Deadline for Submission of Proposals 
