This is our fee proposal for structural engineering services for the above noted project. The project is 
described in your email received April 27, 2023. 
 
Proposed Fees / Project Description 
 
The proposed fixed fee for our services is $2,500. Our fees are for structural engineering services for the 
scope of work described below, only. 
 
Our scope of services includes review of core holes through the Level 1 slab. Each of the proposed core 
locations, as well as the diameter of each, are to be clearly indicated on the Structural Final Design Drawing 
provided by us in PDF format (attached). 
 
Our scope of services includes: 
 Review of proposed core hole locations (2 locations) 
 Preparation of a written report, if required. 
 
Upon acceptance of the proposed fees, we require a retainer for the full amount noted above prior to 
commencement of services. The retainer will be applied to the final invoice. 
 
ln addition to the above fixed fee, we propose to charge for any additional services outside the original 
scope of work on an hourly rates basis in accordance with the following list of hourly charge out rates: 
 
Senior Structural Engineer ..................................................... $250 
 
Structural Technologist / Construction Inspector .................. $150 
 
The contractor will remain responsible for safety in and about the jobsite, and for the adequacy of any 
construction equipment, scaffold, shoring, form, or other work aid used by him. 
 
Please note that we carry sufficient professional liability insurance. 
 
Summary of Typical Services and Exclusions 
 
Our services would not include any of the following:"
