5d9f0c3790a6-4e534c,60070-01,60070-01,Northland Properties Ltd.,Sudbury Sandman Signature Hotel,client,draft,1/2,,2026-07-27,projects,Projects\Projects\06 Hotel\60070-01 (Sandman Signature Hotel - Sudbury ON)\Newforma\email\2026-07\2026-07-27 0920 - Sudbury Signature – Purchase Order for Future Invoices.msg,NPC-003959 KOR Structural .pdf,17,17. ASSIGNMENT AND SUBCONTRACTS,assignment_subconsultants,178,"17. ASSIGNMENT AND SUBCONTRACTS 
The Vendor may not assign or subcontract all or any part of this Purchase Order without 
the prior written consent of the Purchaser. The Vendor will preserve and protect the 
rights of the Purchaser under the Purchase Order with respect to any party with whom 
the Vendor subcontracts for the performance of Services or Supply of Goods hereunder 
and will enter into contracts or written agreements with such subcontractors to require 
them to perform their part of the Services or Supply of Goods hereunder in accordance 
with and subject to the terms and conditions of this Purchase Order. The Vendor shall 
be fully responsible to the Purchaser for the acts and omissions of its subcontractors 
and of persons directly employed by them in the same manner in which the Vendor is 
responsible under this Purchase Order for its acts and omissions. Nothing contained 
herein shall create a contractual relationship between the Purchaser and any party with 
whom the Vendor subcontracts for the performance of Services or Supply of Goods 
pursuant to this Purchase Order."
