Enclosed is our fee proposal for structural engineering services for the above noted project. The project is 
described in your request for fee proposal dated December 5, 2022 and is shown on TKA+D Architecture 
+ Design’s preliminary architectural drawings dated November 29, 2022, provided to us. 
 
Project Description 
 
Our proposed fees are based on the following assumptions: 
 
 A 2-storey light industrial development with retail, office space and 2 levels of below grade 
parking structure. 
 The total gross buildable area including parking for the above is estimated to be 230,707 sq.ft. 
and the estimated breakdown is as follows: 
o 
Commercial: 108,475 sq.ft. gross calculated area. 
o 
Parking: 122,232 sq.ft. gross calculated area. 
 DP Submission – 33% WD: February 2023 
 Issued for Preliminary Pricing – 50% WD: April 202. 
 Building Permit Submission – 66% WD: July 2023 
 Issued for Tender – 80% WD: January 2024 
 Issued for Construction – 100% WD: April 2024 
 Occupancy: April 2026 
 
The below fixed fees are based on 231,000 sq.ft. of structural area. If the final area is increased or 
decreased, then our fees will be adjusted proportionally. 
 
Proposed Fees 
 
The following fees are for complete structural engineering services for the project as noted in the 
following Scope of Structural Services. The proposed fixed fees for our services are as follows:"
