As you know, we have been asked by Bosa Development to provide additional structural engineering services in response to the tenant improvement work and city plan check comments related to the Paladion Remodel. This additional service was not included in our original scope of work for the Façade Replacement to the building.

In order to keep the project moving we have provided these services, as needed, and provided additional structural drawings required to respond to the city plan check. .

This has resulted in additional structural design and document preparation as follows:

Design check of existing structure supporting new mechanical equipment
Response to City of San Diego Plan check comments for Paladion Remodel Permit.
Preparation of structural drawings and details in response to City plan check comments noted in 1.
Review of shop drawings for connection of mechanical equipment to the existing structure.
Review of existing conditions related proposed penetrations thru the ground floor slab.

Our proposed fee for these additional services is $5,000

We have proceeded with this work in good faith. Please return a signed copy of this proposal with your approval.
